      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUPEE'S REVENGE (1) posted a respectable 19.44 when placed over 340m at this track last start in a Grade 5. Hard to top on the time from last start. WYNBURN ELSEY (2) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (20.22) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can improve sharply here. RATE OF KNOTS (8) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fourth (19.58) at this track. Form here sound including eight wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from three attempts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. SHE'S SPECIAL (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
